## Filling the pool

The provider only *claims* subscriptions. Creating them is rate limited, so the
pool is refilled out of band — from cron, a scheduled pipeline, anything that
drops subscriptions into the pool management group. With the Azure CLI:

{{ codefile "shell" "examples/refill-pool.sh" }}

The identity running this needs the billing role that can create subscriptions,
plus Management Group Contributor on the pool group.
